      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The WVTaTiCr coating produces a hard and oxidation-resistant surface layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting surface layer is more uniform than the untreated stainless-steel surface.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating acts as a barrier that impedes diffusion of corrosive ions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating reduces crack propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed barrier mechanism lowers dissolution rates relative to bare stainless steel.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coated stainless steel will have a significantly lower corrosion rate than untreated stainless steel.",
